---
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";

const pillars = ["Christ-Centered", "Church-Owned", "Boy-Focused"];
const growthAreas = ["Wisdom", "Heritage", "Teamwork", "Leadership", "Character", "Faith"];
---

<section id="what-is-trail-life" class="section section--warm">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <SectionHeading eyebrow="New to Trail Life?" title="What Is Trail Life?" />

    <div class="video-wrap">
      <iframe
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/L7zGYASqoBY?si=gtYJwqCu9f4i4Mq3"
        title="YouTube video player"
        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
        referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        allowfullscreen
        loading="lazy"
      ></iframe>
    </div>

    <p>
      Trail Life USA is a Christian, church-based outdoor adventure program for boys ages 5&ndash;17,
      built on three distinctives:
      {" "}
      {pillars.map((p, i) => (
        <>
          <strong class="pillar">{p}</strong>
          {i < pillars.length - 1 ? ", " : ""}
        </>
      ))}.
      Through weekly meetings, hands-on skills, and monthly outdoor adventures &mdash; hiking, camping,
      backpacking &mdash; Trailmen grow in six areas:
    </p>

    <ul class="growth-list">
      {growthAreas.map((area) => <li>{area}</li>)}
    </ul>

    <p>
      It&rsquo;s mentorship and adventure with a clear purpose: raising boys into godly, capable men.
    </p>

    <p>
      Troop 337 is Trail Life&rsquo;s local expression of that mission here in Federal Way, chartered
      through Northwest Church.
    </p>

    <div class="links">
      <a href="https://www.traillifeusa.com/distinctives/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Learn more at TrailLifeUSA.org &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .video-wrap {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .video-wrap iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
    display: block;
  }

  .pillar {
    color: var(--tl-red);
  }

  .growth-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .growth-list li {
    background: var(--tl-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--tl-brown);
    color: var(--tl-brown);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 0.4em 0.9em;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
